    "id": "2cb2c3d4e5f60001",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Node-RED error alert",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Tells you on WhatsApp when a node of this flow fails, at most one message every 10 seconds."
  },
  {
    "id": "2cb2c3d4e5f60002",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "2cb2c3d4e5f60001",
    "name": "Setup",
    "info": "Before you run this flow: open the Turbo Notify account node, paste an API key and press Test. Your Turbo Notify account needs a WhatsApp number linked to it. The key needs the messages:send scope. Replace +12025550123 with the number that should receive the message. The catch node receives the errors of every node on this tab: copy it and the nodes after it to any tab you want to watch. Press the inject button to raise a test error. Errors that arrive faster than one every 10 seconds are dropped, so a broken loop cannot flood your phone.",
    "x": 200,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
